00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.240
If we didn’t have Einstein’s relativity
to explain time discrepancies in GPS satellites,

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:53.120
would we call it Dark Time?

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:55.320
Yep, I’m pretty sure we would.

